[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19141.15, "timestamp": "05:19:01", "text": "你无视了等等，你干了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19145.39, "timestamp": "05:19:05", "text": "问你刚才说的，对了，乔，你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19148.47, "timestamp": "05:19:08", "text": "是的，你好，那意味着，那意味着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19155.47, "timestamp": "05:19:15", "text": "意思是你在看，而且，而且，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19158.548, "timestamp": "05:19:18", "text": "而且，而且，你当时还忘了说“嗨”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19161.75, "timestamp": "05:19:21", "text": "这就是你为什么说的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19172.708, "timestamp": "05:19:32", "text": "等等，你的消息收到了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19175.868, "timestamp": "05:19:35", "text": "YouTube再次屏蔽了YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19179.51, "timestamp": "05:19:39", "text": "我对此无能为力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19181.19, "timestamp": "05:19:41", "text": "啊，你确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19183.19, "timestamp": "05:19:43", "text": "消息等待"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19186.43, "timestamp": "05:19:46", "text": "当然，这确实是一种很蹩脚的说法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19194.03, "timestamp": "05:19:54", "text": "呃，YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19198.43, "timestamp": "05:19:58", "text": "YouTube 就像自动模式一样，你的消息会听到"}]